# PROBCUT: calibrated statistical cutoffs (ProbCut) on the hard ladder.
# Stage 1 on calibration seeds, then all solvers on R6 (6x6 c=5), R7 (7x7 c=6),
# R8 (8x8 c=10) test seeds. About 5 min on 8 vCPU. See probcut/README.md.
probcut:
